  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following planes\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& P: x+y-2 z+7=0 \\\\\n& Q: x+y+2 z+2=0 \\\\\n& R: 3 x+3 y-6 z-11=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
